Package: quarto.collapse.output
Title: Documentation Environment for the Collapse Output Extension
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Declares the R packages the documentation website needs, so
    renv resolves them from this file rather than by scanning the sources.
    This is not an R package; the file exists to give renv an explicit
    dependency list.
Encoding: UTF-8
